#
"ELEMENTAL BLADE"

| $c0011Sintassi         $c0007: cast 'elemental blade'
| $c0011Classi           $c0007: Druido livello 7
| $c0011Costo            $c0007: 10 mana
| $c0011Tipo di danno    $c0007: -
| $c0011Danno            $c0007: -
